WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.910
Step 1. Open the questionnaire. Each time someone saves changed questions,

1.2
00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:10.510
Care raises the version number and keeps the earlier questions as a past version.

2.1
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:14.770
Step 2. Open the version history. Select the Versions tab.

2.2
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:19.609
The current version comes first, then the past versions, newest first,

2.3
00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:22.044
each with the Retired badge.

3.1
00:00:22.044 --> 00:00:25.731
Step 3. Open a past version. Select Open on it.

3.2
00:00:25.731 --> 00:00:31.068
Care shows its questions in read-only form, with the Past revision badge.

3.3
00:00:31.068 --> 00:00:33.981
You cannot change a past version.

4.1
00:00:33.981 --> 00:00:38.563
Step 4. Go back. Select Back to return to the Versions tab.

4.2
00:00:38.563 --> 00:00:43.616
To work on the current version, select Continue Editing on it.
